    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649-a2">

                <pb facs="0809" n="715" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg715"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 2, with dispatch No. 2940, Habana,
                        May 2, 1896.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Office of the Admiral of the Spanish West Indian
                                Squadron</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1896-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May
                                1, 1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your courteous communication of yesterday’s date, personally delivered by you
                    to-day at 2 p.m., and to inform you that the case of the seizure of the schooner
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> being under indictment proceedings
                    (en sumario), it is not possible to answer at present your said communication
                    nor your note relating to same; but I promise to do so at the earliest
                    convenience.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. A. Joss Gomez
                    Imaz.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul-General of the United States</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
